  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "A researcher named Robert Hastings, who wrote a book called UFOs and Nukes about UFO sightings at nuclear weapons sites, says a journalist, George Knapp, told him something in late 2023. According to Hastings, Knapp asked whether he knew that Harry Reid, a US senator, had read the book, and that it was one reason Reid sought funding for AAWSAP, a Pentagon-funded programme that studied unexplained aerial reports. If true, it would mean a book about nuclear sites helped launch official government UFO research."
